  unitName: Sea Prince Verica
  unitId: 20063
  unitNumber: 313
  description: A pirate commander that led a group of pirates in the seas near the
    ruined Sama Kingdom. Though he lived much of his life carefree and without aim,
    once he started caring for Mega, the boy who would come to be known as the Commander,
    he began gathering pirates from all around. Taking lead over most of the other
    pirates around him, Verica came to be known as the Sea Prince. However, he seemed
    much more focused on the development of the child Mega.
  summonDesc: Do you know what I want?<br>I, as Sea Prince, will conquer<br>the seas
    for him!
  fusionDesc: Who's my strength for?<br>Why it's for you, my treasure!<br>That's
    why I must get stronger!
  evoDesc: Changing, faster than ever!<br>From captain to sea royalty!<br>Or maybe
    to a loving father!
  element: 2
  rarity: 3
